,{"class":"dl-faq-copy"},["DIV",{"class":"dl-faq-eyebrow"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"dl-faq-logo"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://localhost:3000/brand/dekat-lokal-icon.png","alt":"","loading":"eager","width":"32","height":"32","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","style":"color:transparent","src":"/brand/dekat-lokal-icon.png"}]],["P",{"class":"dl-section-kicker"},"FAQ"]],["H2",{"id":"faq-title"},"Masih ada yang bikin ragu?"]],["DIV",{"class":"dl-faq-columns"},["SECTION",{"aria-labelledby":"faq-group-0","class":"dl-faq-category"},["H3",{"id":"faq-group-0"},"Tentang Digital Checkup"],["DIV",{"class":"dl-faq-list"},["DETAILS",{"class":"dl-faq-item dl-faq-reference-item is-active","open":""},["SUMMARY",{"aria-expanded":"true"},["SPAN",{},"Apakah Digital Checkup DekatLokal gratis?"],["I",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"dl-faq-toggle"}]],["P",{"class":"dl-faq-answer"},"Iya, gratis. Jawab pertanyaan tentang usahamu, lalu lihat apa yang sudah bagus dan apa yang perlu kamu perbaiki dulu."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"dl-faq-item dl-faq-reference-item"},["SUMMARY",{"aria-expanded":"false"},["SPAN",{},"Apa yang saya dapat setelah mengisi Checkup?"],["I",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"dl-faq-toggle"}]],["P",{"class":"dl-faq-answer"},"Kamu dapat ringkasan kondisi usaha, tiga hal yang perlu didahulukan, dan pilihan materi belajar yang sesuai kebutuhanmu. Jadi, tahu mau mulai dari mana."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"dl-faq-item dl-faq-reference-item"},["SUMMARY",{"aria-expanded":"false"},["SPAN",{},"Apakah harus punya akun dulu?"],["I",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"dl-faq-toggle"}]],["P",{"class":"dl-faq-answer"},"Nggak harus. Kamu bisa isi Digital Checkup dulu tanpa masuk akun. Setelah hasilnya keluar, ikuti petunjuk untuk melanjutkan belajar."]]]],["SECTION",{"aria-labelledby":"faq-group-1","class":"dl-faq-category"},["H3",{"id":"faq-group-1"},"Tentang Ruang Tumbuh"],["DIV",{"class":"dl-faq-list"},["DETAILS",{"class":"dl-faq-item dl-faq-reference-item"},["SUMMARY",{